WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:03.350
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:06.690
Revolver!

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:09.690
Pull yourself together, Revolver!

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:15.690
I didn’t expect the Light 
Ignis to destroy itself.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:18.100
I let my guard down.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:24.420
Bohman, I'll give you everything.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:29.410
Show me mercy.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:34.480
Fine.  I accept everything.

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:47.430
Bohman, my soul is with you.

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:56.030
Lightning gave himself to Bohman.

00:00:56.860 --> 00:01:01.770
Now Bohman has acquired five Attributes.

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:04.740
The stage is set.

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:11.220
I've completed my training.  
Accept my duel, Playmaker!

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:17.220
Yes.  It’s the final fight, Bohman!

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:40.300
Our lives aren't forever

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:47.090
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:54.410
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:01:54.860 --> 00:02:00.980
Sharing hope for the future

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:07.730
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:14.960
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:21.670
I want to share your pain

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:53.490
Here we go, Bohman!

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:54.920
No.

00:02:55.570 --> 00:03:00.600
Let’s go to a stage more 
fitting for our final battle.

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:05.560
What?

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:11.560
This is…

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:14.380
The Central Station courtyard.

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:17.480
Yes.  It's the center of LINK VRAINS.

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:20.310
We'll end things here.

00:03:20.310 --> 00:03:23.550
It’s finally time for the final battle.

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:27.840
This duel will decide humanity's fate.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:32.560
Playmaker, don’t let Revolver’s 
sacrifice go to waste.

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:34.030
We're counting on you.

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:37.030
No way…  Revolver was-

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:38.500
Not just Revolver.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:42.760
Blood Shepherd, Spectre, Soulburner…

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:45.100
And Blue Maiden.

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:50.520
Aoi…

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:54.110
We've had a lot of casualties.

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:58.460
We can’t stand by and do nothing.

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:06.860
Our priority is to help those 
trapped inside LINK VRAINS.

00:04:06.860 --> 00:04:10.540
But we can't use the logout system.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:16.360
Let’s hack and shut down LINK 
VRAINS’s systems.  Then we reboot.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:23.710
But if they're forced to log out 
unexpectedly, everyone might suffer mental damage.

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:25.560
I know.

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:28.000
But nothing'll change if we don’t.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.410
We must do this.

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:37.000
Boss, we were also pulled 
here from the flower field.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.760
What'll happen?

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:44.760
Whatever happens, as long as we have 
this necklace, we have to keep filming!

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:47.720
But if Bohman loses…

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:50.270
It might be the end of our story!

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:53.240
If Playmaker loses…

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:56.710
We might be destroyed with him!

00:04:56.710 --> 00:05:00.180
Either way, it’s the end of our story!

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:02.660
You're no longer needed.

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:05.540
You don't need to broadcast this fight.

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:07.920
Go anywhere you want.

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:16.800
Boss, the necklace is off!  We’re free!

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:20.620
I don’t need freedom anymore!

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:23.420
There’s only one thing we must do!

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:26.430
Film this duel of the ages!

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:29.170
Fire up your journalistic soul!

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:42.850
When this battle ends, the door 
to the new world will open.

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:44.620
New world?

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:48.990
Bohman, what world are you trying to create?

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:53.470
The answer will be revealed in this duel.

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.430
The answer is in this duel?

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:02.870
What?

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:10.350
And it will end in my victory.

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:13.820
He just built a new deck.

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:18.880
Fire, water, earth, wind and light.

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:22.730
That deck has the power of five Ignis.

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:29.210
That’s…

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:31.040
An Ignis algorithm?

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:33.470
What's going to happen?

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:36.600
I don’t know.  But I have a bad feeling.

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:37.410
Let’s hurry!

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:44.350
We must access LINK VRAINS’s 
core and shut down the system.

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:45.660
Okay.

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:52.720
I used to be a great hacker, 
so I should be able to do this.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:55.260
What's this?

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:59.230
The two LINK VRAINS are 
changing simultaneously.

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:01.200
How dare you!

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:04.960
You're using my friends' power?

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:08.210
We’re not your tool!

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:10.000
They’re not tools.

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:12.430
They’re a part of me.

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:15.850
I was created to unite the Ignis into one.

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:22.330
I can use your power to its full potential.

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:30.760
Let’s begin the final 
battle, Playmaker and Ai!

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:35.020
Duel!

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.940
What’s that?

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:45.020
Maybe it’s a sign that we can log out!

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:47.980
Hooray!  I can go home!

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:56.050
What’s this?

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:01.150
What was that just now?

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:03.100
Did you hear it?

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:06.970
Yeah.  Many people screaming.

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:12.040
Hey...

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:14.400
What's wrong?  Answer me!

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:16.570
Hello?

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:20.180
I’m scared to the max!

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:21.910
What?

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:23.880
What’s this?

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:26.400
What’s going on?

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:29.790
Did the Ignis do this?

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:34.350
Bro!  Master!  It’s the final battle.

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:36.330
Roboppi leads the cheering squad!

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:42.230
But why am I able to project this video?

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:45.200
Did I used to have this function?

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:49.800
Gobbledygook.  Am I dumb?

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:52.020
Dumb Roboppi!

00:08:52.950 --> 00:08:55.040
"Dumb" is a forbidden word!

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:58.680
Bro!  Master!  Do your best!

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:04.690
I don’t know why, but I have a 
really bad feeling about this duel.

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:07.050
Something I haven’t felt before.

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:07.890
Yeah.

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:12.860
We're the only ones here, 
but I sense many people.

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:15.600
It's your Link Sense.

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:24.610
Since you can feel the network, you could've 
been the bridge between AIs and humans.

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:26.840
Let’s go, Playmaker!

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:30.650
I'll go first!

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:33.370
When we both have no monsters 
in our Main Monster Zones...

00:09:33.370 --> 00:09:37.820
...I can Special Summon Hydradrive 
Booster from my hand!

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:42.190
Appear!  The circuit that 
determines the truth!

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:47.430
The summoning condition is one Hydradrive!

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:51.740
Link Summon!

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:54.940
Link 1 Grand Hydradrive!

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:59.870
I Special Summon a second 
Hydradrive Booster from my hand!

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:05.780
Appear!  The circuit that 
determines the truth!

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:09.310
The summoning condition is one Hydradrive!

00:10:10.890 --> 00:10:12.660
Link Summon!

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:16.130
Link 1 Coolant Hydradrive!

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:19.870
He hasn't changed his strategy so far.

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:22.070
But we can’t let our guard down.

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:25.940
Appear!  The circuit that 
determines the truth!

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:29.440
The summoning conditions are 
two Hydradrive Link Monsters!

00:10:31.140 --> 00:10:32.540
Link Summon!

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:35.680
Link 2 Twin Hydradrive Knight!

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:39.450
The circuit that determines the truth!

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:43.000
The summoning condition 
is one Hydradrive monster!

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:47.660
Link Summon!

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:51.000
Link 1 Burn Hydradrive!

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:54.820
He used a Link 2 monster 
to summon a Link 1 monster?

00:10:54.820 --> 00:11:00.970
The monsters he summoned so far are 
Earth, Water and Fire Attribute.

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:06.210
I Special Summon a third 
Hydradrive Booster from my hand!

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:11.600
The circuit that determines the truth!

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:14.700
The summoning condition is one Hydradrive!

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:19.390
Link Summon!

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:22.200
Link 1 Flow Hydradrive!

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.000
It's Wind Attribute.

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:30.220
I activate the spell 
card, Hydradrive Rebuild!

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:36.090
I destroy Burn Hydradrive to Special Summon a Hydradrive

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:39.010
from the graveyard by negating its effects!

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:42.180
Come, Twin Hydradrive Knight!

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:46.520
Burn Hydradrive’s effect activates!

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:51.760
When it's destroyed, I Special Summon 
a Hydradrive Token in defense position.

00:11:54.130 --> 00:11:56.990
The circuit that determines the truth!

00:11:58.130 --> 00:12:01.200
The summoning condition is one Hydradrive!

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:05.020
Link Summon!

00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:08.670
Link 1 Alteration Hydradrive!

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:12.880
Alteration Hydradrive’s effect activates!

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:15.210
I select one Hydradrive.

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:19.720
Next to its links, I Special Summon as many 
Hydradrives as I can from the graveyard...

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:25.320
...that have fewer Link Markers 
by negating their effects!

00:12:25.850 --> 00:12:28.790
What?  As many as you can from the graveyard?

00:12:28.790 --> 00:12:33.200
I select Link 2 Twin Hydradrive Knight!

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:37.500
Come, Burn and Coolant Hydradrives!

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:42.740
After they’re Special Summoned, 
Twin Hydradrive Knight is destroyed.

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:47.220
Four Link 1 monsters…

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:52.850
Boss, it’s coming!

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:56.850
A Link 4 monster is coming!

00:12:56.850 --> 00:12:59.440
This is an important moment!

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:01.330
Be quiet and film!

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:04.560
I summon Hydradrive Element.

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:11.000
It didn’t come!

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:16.670
Appear!  The circuit that 
determines the truth!

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:20.140
The summoning condition is one Hydradrive!

00:13:20.140 --> 00:13:21.880
Link Summon!

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:25.080
Link 1 Grand Hydradrive!

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:28.090
Another Link 1…

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:31.790
Hydradrive Element’s effect activates!

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:39.260
When it's used to Link Summon, I select one 
monster on the field and one Attribute.

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:45.000
That monster’s Attribute becomes the same 
as the one I chose until the end of the turn.

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:47.240
Change the Attribute?

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:52.710
My Alteration Hydradrive 
becomes Light Attribute.

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:58.780
Is he trying to fill the entire field?

00:13:58.780 --> 00:14:02.190
Five Attributes and five Link Monsters…

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:06.400
But that doesn't mean he's summoning 
a monster with five Attributes.

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:10.760
As far as I know, there's no 
Link 5 monster in LINK VRAINS.

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:16.770
Ai, your ideas have reached its limits.

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:19.180
If it doesn’t exist, create it.

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:21.240
I can do that.

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:23.710
I activate my Skill!

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:26.180
Skill?

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:36.780
Here it comes again!

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:45.340
Last time, it happened 
at the start of the duel.

00:14:45.340 --> 00:14:49.830
This time, it’s when Bohman used his Skill.

00:14:49.830 --> 00:14:54.580
These occurrences coincide with the duel.

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:57.810
There must be a trick to it.

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:04.220
Again!

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:07.690
Yeah.  I hear many screams.

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:14.630
That Data Storm is powerful!

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:23.350
Once per turn, I randomly select a Cyberse 
monster in the Data Storm

00:15:23.350 --> 00:15:25.340
and add it to my Extra Deck!

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:30.270
That Data Storm is…

00:15:30.270 --> 00:15:35.610
Come!  The new card created from my will!

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:37.980
Master Storm Access!

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:45.890
They're knocked out!

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:49.560
What’s happening?

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:53.330
This is bad!  If that 
light hits you, you die!

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:54.520
Run!

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:55.300
Hide!

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.770
Now everything is ready.

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:03.910
Appear!  The circuit that 
determines the truth!

00:16:04.740 --> 00:16:09.710
The summoning conditions are five Link 
Monsters with different Attributes!

00:16:10.520 --> 00:16:12.180
No way…

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:19.420
Link Summon!

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:22.130
Appear, Link 5!

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:35.680
Chimera Hydradrive Dragrid!

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:39.210
Seriously?  A Link 5?

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:42.920
Chimera Hydradrive Dragrid’s 
effect activates!

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:49.120
When it's Special Summoned from the Extra 
Deck, I place one Hydradrive Counter.

00:16:50.450 --> 00:16:53.390
He summoned a Link 5?

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:58.680
He easily leaps LINK VRAINS's hurdles.

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:04.370
Every time he performs an action, a 
phenomenon occurs in LINK VRAINS...

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:07.970
He must be using people.

00:17:10.020 --> 00:17:12.880
He really summoned a Link 5!

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:14.950
Does that mean he’s better than us?

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:18.700
The screams we've been hearing…

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:21.420
It may be connected to this.

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:23.640
Exactly.

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:28.890
You’re hearing the consciousness 
of the people in LINK VRAINS.

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:31.100
LINK VRAINS?

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:32.860
What did you do?

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:35.060
A Neuron Link.

00:17:35.060 --> 00:17:36.760
Neuron Link?

00:17:36.760 --> 00:17:40.620
It’s the ultimate system I created.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:44.840
I pull out and use the 
human brains' capabilities.

00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:49.620
That's how you built that Data Storm?

00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:53.050
But that was an enormous Data Storm.

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:58.260
One human brain can’t create 
a Data Storm that big.

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:02.450
The calculations of thousands 
of humans are required.

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:06.530
Their thoughts becomes my power.

00:18:06.530 --> 00:18:12.540
So those humans created 
this Link 5 monster card.

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:19.360
The unconscious had their brain power 
consumed, becoming hollow shells.

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:22.510
It’s a horrible system.

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:29.590
If Bohman keeps dueling Playmaker, 
LINK VRAINS will have more victims.

00:18:29.590 --> 00:18:34.490
Bohman!  What you say and what 
you do are contradictory!

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:37.060
Contradictory?  Me?

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:43.500
When Lightning used Kusanagi’s brother 
as a shield, you said that was unfair!

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:44.870
Exactly.

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:47.870
You’re alike!

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:52.880
You’ve trapped humans inside 
LINK VRAINS to use their brains!

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:54.820
I don’t understand.

00:18:54.820 --> 00:19:00.700
Lightning used Jin Kusanagi’s 
consciousness as a shield to stop Revolver from fighting.

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:03.350
I’m not doing that.

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:08.780
This is only a part of my abilities.

00:19:08.780 --> 00:19:12.300
You can't treat me the same as Lightning.

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:14.180
Stop joking!

00:19:14.180 --> 00:19:16.480
What'll happen to those 
who lost consciousness?

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:18.270
They're the same as dead!

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:20.740
Life and consciousness are different.

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:26.710
Their consciousness will live 
forever as a part of me.

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:32.520
Everything will unite inside 
me and be reflected in my will.

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:35.490
That’s your new world?

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:38.490
You're fine if you're 
the only one who exists?

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:40.960
That’s called a dictator!

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:45.280
Dictator?  That’s an 
extravagant way to put it.

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:49.220
The world will become one under me.

00:19:49.220 --> 00:19:51.740
I don’t understand!

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:53.820
That’s too bad.

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:58.810
But I never thought you'd understand.

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:01.380
I end my turn.

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:07.820
When I win, I’ll use the Neuron Link to 
instantly take over the world’s network.

00:20:07.820 --> 00:20:11.820
And people in real life 
will be under my control.

00:20:11.820 --> 00:20:15.520
You think you're a god because 
you summoned a Link 5?

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:19.300
Even if it’s a Link 5, 
there's a way to deal with it!

00:20:19.300 --> 00:20:21.530
My turn!  I draw!

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:24.080
We have to do that move!

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:25.470
Exactly.

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:28.000
I summon Widget Kid!

00:20:30.770 --> 00:20:32.760
Due to Widget Kid’s effect,

00:20:32.760 --> 00:20:37.280
I Special Summon Cyberse Synchron from my hand in defense position!

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:41.660
Cyberse Synchron’s effect activates!

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:46.360
I raise Widget Kid’s Level from 3 to 6!

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:51.100
Check out what we're building!  Go!

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:57.760
Level 1 Cyberse Synchron 
tunes Level 6 Widget Kid!

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:03.410
Flash of lightning!

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:07.660
The unknown power transforms 
into a soaring dragon!

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:15.560
Synchro Summon!

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:20.940
Descend!  Cyberse Quantum Dragon!

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:28.770
Your monster has 4000 ATK.

00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:31.230
But when Quantum Dragon battles,

00:21:31.230 --> 00:21:35.020
its effect can return your monster to your deck!

00:21:35.200 --> 00:21:36.870
How’s that!

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:40.180
Too bad, but that won’t work.

00:21:40.180 --> 00:21:41.650
What?

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:45.280
I know everything you’re going to do.

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:47.620
I activate my Skill!

00:21:48.400 --> 00:21:50.620
Another Skill?

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:55.860
Again!

00:21:55.860 --> 00:22:03.870
Watch and feel my duel that 
surpasses your imagination!

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:09.560
I was told repeatedly

00:22:09.560 --> 00:22:17.040
Only tales of dreams

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:24.010
Is my life precious?

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:26.980
Make up for  Make up for

00:22:27.370 --> 00:22:34.520
The next sentimental

00:22:39.350 --> 00:22:45.770
I'm not a machine

00:22:48.490 --> 00:22:52.210
I cry a single tear

00:22:53.700 --> 00:22:57.410
A single answer moves me

00:22:58.600 --> 00:23:07.790
We helplessly sing for someone we can't reach

00:23:08.410 --> 00:23:13.190
Are you ready?

00:23:13.720 --> 00:23:18.570
Oh oh oh

00:23:19.090 --> 00:23:23.770
Are you ready?

00:23:24.390 --> 00:23:30.880
Are you ready?

00:23:37.860 --> 00:23:44.770
As the Neuron Link expands, the 
pile of avatar corpses grows.

00:23:44.770 --> 00:23:49.740
This is the first step to the new world?

00:23:49.740 --> 00:23:55.560
In this nightmare, Bohman's power increases!

00:23:55.560 --> 00:24:00.420
I won't accept an ideal world 
built upon others' sacrifices!

00:24:00.420 --> 00:24:04.090
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Twisted Utopia

00:24:04.090 --> 00:24:06.340
Into the VRAINS!
